WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.134
-We don't always
have enough time

00:00:02.134 --> 00:00:03.570
to cover everything
in the recent news.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.505
So here with a recap is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:09.709
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:12.811
-You guys!
Things have been crazy!

00:00:12.811 --> 00:00:15.848
Okay, first of all,
I found out it was Pride Month,

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.283
and I was like, "What?!"

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:20.620
Then I realized people finally
get to celebrate in person,

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.121
and I was like, "What, what!"

00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:23.857
Then I found out that cops

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.692
weren't gonna be allowed
to participate,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:29.862
and I was like [Laughs]
"What...do you expect?"

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:31.798
The very first pride march
happened

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.566
because police raided a gay bar.

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:38.138
So I guess the theme of this
year's pride is "Consequences."

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:41.540
So then everyone was like, "Have
you heard about the bee beef?"

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.742
And I was like, "What?

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.077
That sounds gross,
but I will try a bite."

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:48.314
And they were like, "No, two
beekeepers are beefing online!"

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:49.415
And I was like, "People care?"

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.250
And they were like, "Girl, yes."

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.652
And I was like,
"Let me take a look."

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.821
Okay, so first,
there was this video

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:57.756
of a woman with
a big old swarm of bees!

00:00:57.756 --> 00:01:00.526
She was like, "I'm gonna remove
them," and I was like, "What?"

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:03.596
This child was messing around
with a swarm of bees

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:04.930
with no protective gear,

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:06.833
just scooping 'em up
with her bare hands,

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.234
and I was like, "What?"

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:12.004
Then she did something
that blew my frickin' mind.

00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:14.640
She was like, "I'm looking
for a queen in this swarm,

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.708
but I can't find her.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.876
Luckily, I have one on me."

00:01:17.876 --> 00:01:21.781
Then this woman pulled
a queen bee out of her pocket,

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:24.317
and everyone was like, "What?

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:27.019
We are emotionally invested
in her!"

00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:29.255
Personally, I was like,
"I hate most of this,

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.890
but I have to admit,
that was cool."

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.025
Then you will never believe
what happened.

00:01:33.025 --> 00:01:34.794
A second bee lady made a video

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:37.463
about how the other bee lady's
video is staged!

00:01:37.463 --> 00:01:39.098
She was like,
"Her husband helped her,

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:41.000
and you don't see all
the prepping that was done."

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.636
And I was like,
"What...a scandal!"

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.606
And she was like, "Also,
to not have any safety gear

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.307
and your hair down
is dangerous."

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:50.109
And I was like, "What a burn!"

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:51.944
And then she said this.

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:55.681
-I'm straight up calling her out
and saying what you do is fake.

00:01:55.681 --> 00:01:58.217
@texasbeeworks, I see you.

00:01:58.217 --> 00:01:59.351
We all see you.

00:01:59.351 --> 00:02:02.721
All of us female removal
specialists, we see you.

00:02:02.721 --> 00:02:04.557
We know you're faking.

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:07.327
-And I was like, "What drama!"

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:09.829
Is there anything
that women can't fake?

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:13.499
And that, ladies and gentlemen,
is bee...f.

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:15.968
Then there was
another giant saga

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.637
you are never going to believe.

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:20.439
Okay, so Naomi Osaka,
everyone's favorite,

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:22.508
was like, "I will not
be participating

00:02:22.508 --> 00:02:24.310
in the press events
at the French Open.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.944
I gotta think about
my mental health."

00:02:25.944 --> 00:02:27.246
And we were like, "What."

00:02:27.246 --> 00:02:29.849
But a lot of people
were like, "What?!"

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:31.651
And then
the French Open was like,

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:35.087
"If you skip press, we are
going to fine you $15,000."

00:02:35.087 --> 00:02:36.422
And then she was like, "What."

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:39.525
Skipped it, paid the fine,
did not give a rip.

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:41.694
And then they were like, "Well,
if you keep skipping press,

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:43.229
then we might not
let you compete!"

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:46.599
And she was like, "What?
Oh, okay. I quit!"

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:49.635
Except she's not very loud, so
she was probably like, "I quit."

00:02:49.635 --> 00:02:51.604
And you know that
when she did that,

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:54.206
the French Open people
were like, "Quoi?"

00:02:54.206 --> 00:02:57.143
These people were like, "Who
cares about your mental health?"

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:58.877
Well, turns out you do.

00:02:58.877 --> 00:03:02.014
Now, the way they treated her
made me so mad that I was like,

00:03:02.014 --> 00:03:06.185
"May the press at the
French Open forever be cursed!"

00:03:06.185 --> 00:03:09.788
And then it was, because another
athlete at the French Open,

00:03:09.788 --> 00:03:14.561
Petra Kvitová, had to drop out
because she got an ankle injury

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:17.830
but not while playing,
during press.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.699
And I was like, "What?
I caused this!"

00:03:20.699 --> 00:03:22.668
Y'all, I cursed it!

00:03:22.668 --> 00:03:25.337
I guess I'm too powerful
for my own good.

00:03:25.337 --> 00:03:28.574
I have since recognized my gifts
and lifted the curse.

00:03:28.574 --> 00:03:32.879
And that was the coolest thing
I ever saw until this.

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:34.547
[ Dogs barking ]

00:03:38.317 --> 00:03:41.287
I saw that and was like, "What?

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.923
What the hell
is wrong with you?"

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:46.925
This teenage girl pushed a bear
to save her dog!

00:03:46.925 --> 00:03:48.260
Now, let me tell you something.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.664
If a bear wants to eat my dog,
I will pass the salt!

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:53.833
Girl, you got like six dogs.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.301
Make do with five.

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:59.037
Under no circumstances
would I ever fight a bear.

00:03:59.037 --> 00:04:01.474
Unless they had something to say
about Naomi Osaka.

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:03.008
Then that bear better square up.

00:04:03.008 --> 00:04:05.344
The next day, people will be
like, "What a nice coat."

00:04:05.344 --> 00:04:08.180
And I'll be like, "Thank you.
This bear was talking trash."

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:11.217
Then Simone Biles
made gymnastics history

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:13.252
by throwing
a Yurchenko double pike!

00:04:13.252 --> 00:04:14.721
You got to see it!

00:04:19.191 --> 00:04:21.093
-Wow.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:21.093 --> 00:04:24.162
-What are that woman's legs
made of?

00:04:24.162 --> 00:04:25.965
Springs?
Jet packs?

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:27.266
I saw that, and I was like,

00:04:27.266 --> 00:04:30.302
"They need to name that move
after her."

00:04:30.302 --> 00:04:31.404
But then I remembered

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:34.206
she already has four moves
named after her.

00:04:34.206 --> 00:04:36.309
This move is called the Biles.

00:04:40.646 --> 00:04:43.449
This move is called the Biles.

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:45.951
-Backflip, backflip.

00:04:45.951 --> 00:04:48.320
Double, double.
Oh, there it is.

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.690
-This move is called the Biles.

00:04:52.859 --> 00:04:55.094
-And here's the other Biles.

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:57.997
-And this move
is called the Biles, too.

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:00.900
-There she goes.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.735
And there it is.

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:04.203
-So I guess they're
gonna have to

00:05:04.203 --> 00:05:06.272
call this new vault "The Don't,"

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:09.074
as in, if Simone Biles
is competing

00:05:09.074 --> 00:05:11.778
and you think you have a shot,
you don't.

00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:14.013
So I was so inspired by her

00:05:14.013 --> 00:05:17.149
that I'm going to attempt
my very own gymnastics move

00:05:17.149 --> 00:05:19.418
now on live-to-tape TV.

00:05:19.418 --> 00:05:21.754
It's called the Amber.

00:05:26.825 --> 00:05:28.294
[ Exhales sharply ]

00:05:45.111 --> 00:05:47.847
Yay!
I did it!

00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:49.148
Damn right 10.

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:51.084
This has been "Amber Says What."

